# Build Process Watcher — JVM Telemetry Samples (`{{VERSION_TAG}}`)

Time-series JVM telemetry from real Gradle and Kotlin CI builds collected with [Build Process Watcher](https://github.com/cdsap/build-process-watcher) without injecting a Java agent.

