| Metric | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Total sample rows | `{{TOTAL_ROWS}}` |
| Distinct CI build runs (`run_id`) | `{{DISTINCT_RUNS}}` |
| Date coverage (UTC) | `{{MIN_DATE}}` to `{{MAX_DATE}}` |
| Parquet size | `{{TOTAL_SIZE_MB}} MB` (`{{SHARD_COUNT}}` shard(s)) |
